{"3735270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "IT BEGAN", "steam_appid": 3735270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/41930dceed63b5c44f82fc6abe4d5528.avif?t=1788330579\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Nikki… Nikki, damn it… can you hear me? Wake up… please…&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Nairhad — the sunken city that never stopped breathing. </strong>IT BEGAN is a single-player tactical horror shooter set in the drowned ruins of a forgotten metropolis.<br>You awaken in silence, alone… but never truly alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the cult that worships the abyss.<br>Fight twisted creatures born in salt and madness.<br>And uncover the fragmented memories of a man who may no longer be himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corridor is a secret.<br>Every shadow is a whisper.<br>And something — something beneath the water — is waiting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/fa94840b16471b8da1a6b47d842b208e.avif?t=1788330579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras_big/fa94840b16471b8da1a6b47d842b208e.webp?t=1788330579 width=1600 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The city sleeps… but the water remembers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nairhad isn’t just a location — it’s a living tomb.<br>You’ll walk through flooded corridors, derelict chambers, and crumbling monuments of a civilization that tried to forget itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is rare. Oxygen is precious. And silence is never complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner holds a secret.<br>Every step pulls you deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/e6eddb0a3c4a2bf150c6d7355c1808cb.poster.avif?t=1788330579\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/e6eddb0a3c4a2bf150c6d7355c1808cb.webm?t=1788330579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/e6eddb0a3c4a2bf150c6d7355c1808cb.mp4?t=1788330579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/8195dc4413fb8bbee070726e9a6c1f50.avif?t=1788330579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras_big/8195dc4413fb8bbee070726e9a6c1f50.webp?t=1788330579 width=1600 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Violence is not always the answer. But silence… often is.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use darkness to your advantage. Lure enemies into traps. Disable lights. Distract with noise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/2bca596b9533132b12cb2a324c5ff038.poster.avif?t=1788330579\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/2bca596b9533132b12cb2a324c5ff038.webm?t=1788330579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/2bca596b9533132b12cb2a324c5ff038.mp4?t=1788330579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IT BEGAN rewards patience, precision, and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a soldier. You are the only one left who can disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/8fbcd409eee199bf977a2e32057a48c7.poster.avif?t=1788330579\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/8fbcd409eee199bf977a2e32057a48c7.webm?t=1788330579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/8fbcd409eee199bf977a2e32057a48c7.mp4?t=1788330579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/3b649fe8310c8f8c26f28e6a2fb17dc2.avif?t=1788330579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras_big/3b649fe8310c8f8c26f28e6a2fb17dc2.webp?t=1788330579 width=1600 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Who were you before Nairhad took you in?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the ruins, echoes of your past surface through broken machinery, scattered notes, and hallucinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories twist. Reality bends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth isn’t waiting to be found — it’s waiting to be remembered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/a93faded44250b3af1b65e93f3f95ff7.poster.avif?t=1788330579\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/a93faded44250b3af1b65e93f3f95ff7.webm?t=1788330579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/a93faded44250b3af1b65e93f3f95ff7.mp4?t=1788330579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/63973783656e59247a5f252aef815967.avif?t=1788330579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras_big/63973783656e59247a5f252aef815967.webp?t=1788330579 width=1600 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You were never meant to return. But the cult remembers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fanatics lurk in the deep, protecting something ancient.<br>Creatures shift in the shadows — born not of flesh, but of water, bone, and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy has a purpose. Every encounter, a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are waiting to kill you.<br>Others… to wake you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/dda1d24c16b332d1664ffafcdb2746dc.poster.avif?t=1788330579\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/dda1d24c16b332d1664ffafcdb2746dc.webm?t=1788330579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/dda1d24c16b332d1664ffafcdb2746dc.mp4?t=1788330579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></